# The revealed card stays revealed only while Weirding's effect needs it (CR 701.20a). Nobody pays for the first draw of
# Bot1's Ancestral Recall, and one of two Words of Wind effects replaces the draw Weirding leaves (CR 614.5, 616.1f), so
# the revealed Island stays on top of the library, hidden again: as the second draw's replacements are ordered, nobody
# sees it.
[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Zur's Weirding
Words of Wind
Ancestral Recall
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

